ime": 1843.19, "timestamp": "00:30:43", "text": "得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1844.87, "timestamp": "00:30:44", "text": "取消我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1847.07, "timestamp": "00:30:47", "text": "高级订阅之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1849.63, "timestamp": "00:30:49", "text": "以前情况不一样，但我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1850.91, "timestamp": "00:30:50", "text": "他们可能是缺钱之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1853.75, "timestamp": "00:30:53", "text": "所以，我觉得我不能用 Beam 来进行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1859.19, "timestamp": "00:30:59", "text": "不再支持同时向 Twitch 和 Kick 直播。"}]